  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"> </a></p><p>这个模组为<strong>Gateways to Eternity</strong>模组中的传送门添加了<strong>随机生成机制</strong>。<br>它旨在通过让强大的传送门在游戏过程中意外出现，来增加悬疑感和刺激感。</p><ul>\n<li>选择一个<strong>主世界中的随机玩家</strong>。</li>\n<li>在该玩家周围<strong>50到300格范围内</strong>选择一个<strong>地表方块</strong>作为潜在的生成位置。</li>\n<li>在<strong>白天的一个随机时间</strong>生成传送门，并不一定在日出时。</li>\n</ul><h3 style=\"color:#fff\">生成几率变化</h3><ul>\n<li>如果生成失败，每天几率会提高：\n<ul>\n<li><strong>20% → 40% → 60% → 80%</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>成功生成后：\n<ul>\n<li>几率重置为<strong>20%</strong></li>\n<li><strong>第二天不会再有传送门生成</strong>（以防止生成过多）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3 style=\"color:#fff\">视觉反馈与集成</h3><ul>\n<li>当传送门即将出现时，会显示一条<strong>通知</strong>。</li>\n<li>如果安装了<strong>JourneyMap</strong>：\n<ul>\n<li>会自动在传送门位置创建一个<strong>路径点</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>一道<strong>光束</strong>通过<strong>FTB Map</strong>标记出传送门的位置。</li>\n<li>传送门所在的区块会通过<strong>FTB Chunks</strong>进行<strong>强制加载</strong>，以确保稳定生成。</li>\n</ul><h2 style=\"color:#fff\">模组展示视频</h2><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/o_Y4DdeJtKA\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500px\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><div>\n<h3 style=\"color:#fff\">依赖项</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none;margin-right:25px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gateways-to-eternity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img style=\"width:40px;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/585/611/64/64/637952776300526311_animated.gif\" alt=\"图标\"> <span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">Gateways to Eternity（必需）</span></div>\n</a><a style=\"text-decoration:none;margin-right:25px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img style=\"width:40px;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/972/573/64/64/638474885347244172.png\" alt=\"图标\"> <span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">FTB Chunks（必需）</span></div>\n</a><a style=\"text-decoration:none;margin-right:25px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"display:flex\"><img style=\"width:40px;margin-right:10px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/9/144/64/64/635421614078544069.png\" alt=\"图标\"> <span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">JourneyMap（可选）</span></div>\n</a></div>\n</div>",
